      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:1et9jdf'
    '|a||How sure are we? That a lasting raise moves spending more than a one-off bonus: mostly agreed.':
