      voice: 'gemini:Achird | curious, open-minded economist host who loves a puzzle; warm, thinks aloud, brisk lively pace (never slow, never rushed); takes objections seriously, never preachy #ctx:wftk4b'
    '|b||How much people really smooth, and why they hold on to wealth: contested. The evidence deserves a lecture of its own.':
