      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:l487f2'
    '|a||Three new cases. A Harbourtown fisher has a record season, but expects normal catches from next year on. What does the permanent income idea predict?':
